  "_meta": {
    "shipped": "v10.323",
    "description": "Marks which KPIs are FIXED at bank level (everyone scores against the same bank-wide target). Non-fixed KPIs use cascaded individual targets or role-default targets. Per Joshua's v10.318 reminder: CX Score, Audit Score, Staff Productivity etc are bank-wide. v10.323 also marks bank-wide financial outcomes (PBT, Total NFI, NPL Ratio, etc.) since these are organisation-level metrics everyone scores against uniformly.",
    "rule": "A KPI in this list scores everyone against bank_targets[KPI|YEAR]. A KPI NOT in this list scores each staff against their cascaded target (target_cascade), or a role default target (role_default_targets.json), in that order."
